          "prompt": "A pure illustrated anime image. \n\nThe camera angle is from the back of the character, a back-facing shot.\n\n2D line-art with cel-shaded color fills, expressive outlines, and stylized anime anatomy. Scene is drawn entirely as an illustration.  Absolutely no realism, no photo textures, no 3D render qualities — strictly anime illustration style.",
